<title>USA: PMC Commercial Trust raises qtly dividend.</title>
<headline>PMC Commercial Trust raises qtly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>PMC Commercial Trust on Monday increased its quarterly dividend by $0.01 to $0.41 from $0.40 previously.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid on July 15 1997 to shareholders of record June 30 1997.</p>
<p>The dividend has been increased for the eleventh consecutive quarter. The annual indicated dividend was raised from $1.60 to $1.64.</p>
<p>PMC Commercial Trust is a commercial finance company.</p>
</text>
